                <pb facs="0570" n="458" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg458"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Fox to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-05-24"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 24,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ecuadorian Government received yesterday from Argentine minister at Lima, over
                    his signature, full text note. Formalities now completed. We are having to-day
                    conference with minister for foreign affairs, at his request, for the purpose of
                    discussing Ecuador reply to joint note.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
